<title>JAPAN: JGBs, euroyen futures up sharply in late Tokyo.</title>
<headline>JGBs, euroyen futures up sharply in late Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The prices of Japanese government bond (JGB) futures and three-month euroyen futures rose sharply in late Tokyo trading on Friday in reaction to the results of Japan's industrial output data for May, traders said.</p>
</text>
